  "004": {
    "text": "1988年，Halzen和 John G. Learned 提出：别造一座小探测器，把南极深冰本身变成望远镜。冰够大、够安静，也足够透明。这个思路后来经过 AMANDA 等试验，才走向 Ice Cube。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "D:\\python_project\\tts\\models\\Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261010,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 1536,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "66213c194de8084ac82671b7122cfc5fd5253c7e45c634b9ec8c1fdde981a629",
    "file": "audio/v03/raw/004.wav",
    "seconds": 17.6,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "b30deb7eddf11be45ca8169acdddd92878ea21f446296487fa5b4ffa6c89e70a",
    "elapsedSeconds": 75.32371592521667
  },
  "005": {
    "text": "Ice Cube把八十六条探测器串放进冰层，每串六十个光学模块，深度约一千四百五十到两千四百五十米，覆盖近一立方公里。镜头顺着一条串下潜，传感器在黑暗中排成网。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "D:\\python_project\\tts\\models\\Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261011,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 1536,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "043f77693b16da2f942957ced1942aa8993909a4f011c224aaaeb86ec27dceb7",
    "file": "audio/v03/raw/005.wav",
