    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "91a6946cbe965a8e6b67eb095c7679609beb378769c8aab46a782448f7e938bb",
    "elapsedSeconds": 65.682288646698
  },
  "006": {
    "text": "中微子本身不会发光，只有极少数会撞上冰中的原子核，产生带电粒子。粒子飞得足够快，就在冰里拉出 Cherenkov 蓝光。模块记录每一束光抵达的时间和亮度；我们看到的是间接回应，不是把中微子直接拍下来。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "D:\\python_project\\tts\\models\\Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261012,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.42,
      "top_p": 0.85,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "max_new_tokens": 1536,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "05d0e746e2ad9f9ed750cfc7a07d9d38b1ad97380f943cca5faaad4637871a26",
    "file": "audio/v03/raw/006.wav",
    "seconds": 15.440041666666668,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "e6b62c8bbd14f4ebecbfd5715aef32c007c6857fd11ce5c35d51b3f3c8ea6b19",
    "elapsedSeconds": 79.80243372917175
  },
  "007": {
    "text": "关键阈值写成公式就是：速度 v 大于光速 c 除以折射率 n。n 让光在冰里变慢；粒子超过这个相速度，光就从四面散开，收束成可追踪的圆锥。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "D:\\python_project\\tts\\models\\Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
